1
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,720
Dad,

2
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,320
How

3
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:38,520
will this end?

4
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,640
You mean

5
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,200
the Deputy Brigade Commander's concerns

6
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,240
about the information leak,

7
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:43,720
right?

8
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:44,640
Right.

9
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,480
If we figure out a way

10
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,280
to ease his mind,

11
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,280
wouldn't that solve it?

12
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,520
Your brother gave me a call

13
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,480
and said Liang Hong

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,880
has found some relevant military experts.

15
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,280
I have some experts here too.

16
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,920
You should contact them later.

17
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,400
Then,

18
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,160
we'll organize the experts

19
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:04,920
to have a meeting

20
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,360
and look into it.

21
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,320
Once we come up with a practical,

22
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,720
feasible plan

23
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,440
to ease his mind,

24
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,960
won't this whole matter be over?

25
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,720
Besides,

26
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,960
you must apologize to the commander.

27
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,680
Me?

28
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,440
Fine.

29
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,120
I was indeed a bit out of line.

30
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,120
When I find the time,

31
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,720
I'll go and apologize to him.

32
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:32,920
By the way, Dad.

33
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,560
About this Liang Hong...

34
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,280
I asked around for you.

35
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,680
Rank of Captain, Ph.D. graduate.

36
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,640
Most importantly, she's single.

37
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,880
You asked around for me?

38
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,480
Who asked you to do that?

39
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:49,000
I'm locking down your future daughter-in-law.

40
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
You have no idea.

41
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,720
There's this kind of

42
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,200
chemistry between them.

43
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,200
A very special feeling.

44
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,320
Your brother and Liang Hong are in the same unit.

45
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,760
It's not appropriate for them to date.

46
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,880
Why?

47
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,960
Soldiers are people too.

48
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,560
Is there a military regulation

49
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,160
that two officers in the same unit

50
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:08,960
aren't allowed to date?

51
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,200
What do you know?

52
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,560
One is a Battalion Commander, one is a Staff Officer.

53
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,200
If a war breaks out

54
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,000
and they disagree,

55
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,240
how will the unit be commanded?

56
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,320
We're not at war right now, are we?

57
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,800
Who can guarantee

58
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,000
that tomorrow

59
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,240
a war won't break out?

60
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,600
Dad, can you stop trying to scare me?

61
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,800
I am not just being alarmist.

62
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,680
Do you understand?

63
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,920
Dad,

64
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,200
have you noticed?

65
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,680
Whenever the military is mentioned,

66
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,960
you immediately get so formal.

67
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,840
Like you're about to charge into battle.

68
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:57,280
If we came just to see these gadgets,

69
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:59,040
and put together a team for it,

70
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,440
then this trip would be quite worthless.

71
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,560
But just now,

72
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,320
your superior told me

73
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,920
that this is where the unit's

74
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:09,520
new-type combat forces take off.

75
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:10,440
So,

76
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,000
I feel the significance is different now.

77
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,000
Just now,

78
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,920
the two civilian technical experts

79
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,640
have made their appraisal.

80
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,800
You can use them with confidence.

81
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,640
There are no backdoors.

82
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:23,520
As for data collection,

83
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:26,240
the initiative, and even the power of life and death,

84
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,240
are entirely in the hands of the users.

85
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,800
Professor Xu is right.

86
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,680
Every manufacturer providing us with products

87
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,000
is a unit that has

88
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,480
national defense production qualifications.

89
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,840
In short,

90
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,800
we're all on the same side.

91
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,320
Therefore,

92
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,200
you can use them with confidence.

93
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,000
Actually,

94
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,000
simulation training at this technical level

95
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:53,000
can only address the most basic combined arms modes.

96
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,600
In short,

97
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,040
it's what Battalion Commander Guo just introduced:

98
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:59,280
the preliminary concept of the Value Cube.

99
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,960
But to form an organic whole,

100
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:04,120
we must bring out the equipment's

101
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,640
and personnel's true inherent value.

102
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,680
However, the manifestation of this value

103
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,440
depends on massive amounts of data and information.

104
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:14,120
Professor Xu and I just discussed it,

105
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,000
and we'll integrate our ready-made

106
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:19,600
research results for simulation training

107
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,120
into your platform,

108
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:23,120
thereby comprehensively improving

109
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,520
the new-type combat forces'

110
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,240
and traditional equipment's

111
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,680
combined efficiency.

112
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:28,440
Right.

113
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,680
It's completely free. We won't charge a penny.

114
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,840
That's wonderful.

115
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,440
Thank you, experts, for answering our questions,

116
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,760
and sharing valuable experience.

117
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,400
Although this issue is resolved,

118
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,280
the lessons it leaves behind

119
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,040
are still worth our reflection.

120
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,200
Exactly. Exactly.

121
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,400
Let's imagine.

122
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,720
If we were to take this matter

123
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,080
and reverse the current procedure,

124
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:04,360
going through it all over again,

125
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,400
would the outcome

126
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,800
be any better?

127
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,040
Through that lesson just now,

128
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,600
I am

129
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,280
deeply moved,

130
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,520
and filled with emotion.

131
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,400
I've learned a great deal.

132
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,840
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

133
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,480
I was young and arrogant,

134
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,680
lacking in self-control.

135
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:24,720
I was ignorant,

136
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,520
and poorly disciplined.

137
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,760
The other day, I said a bunch of

138
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,720
uncultured and impolite things

139
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,920
that caused you great emotional harm.

140
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,560
I'm sorry.

141
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,520
Miss,

142
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,120
please don't do this.

143
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,240
You're making me embarrassed.

144
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,000
Please, don't.

145
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,080
If you don't forgive me,

146
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,120
I'd be too ashamed to get up.

147
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,400
No, no.

148
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,560
I forgive you. I forgive you.

149
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,200
I hope you can forgive me too.

150
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,160
No, no.

151
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:41,960
Let's shake hands.

152
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,200
We're all good friends.

153
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,760
Sir!

154
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,600
Sir,

155
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,240
I'm young,

156
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,280
and inexperienced.

157
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,360
But I'm very willing

158
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,240
to serve the military's national defense development.

159
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,520
I hope you can give me another chance

160
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,360
to continue our cooperation.

161
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,520
You little girl,

162
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,160
what other chance do you need?

163
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,160
There's a pile of contracts waiting for you to sign.

164
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,720
Does that mean you agree?

165
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,360
Don't try to trap me.

166
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,560
I don't have that much power.

167
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,040
Before the experts arrived,

168
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,200
we had already reported to our superiors.

169
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,160
As long as the experts prove it feasible,

170
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,240
and sign off on it,

171
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,280
and most importantly,

172
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,560
the trial training is successful,

173
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,320
the contract can be signed immediately.

174
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,640
Our Sir is just too adorable.

175
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:21,520
Much cuter than the rigid and dogmatic Guo Zijian.

176
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:24,800
Report!

177
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,720
Well, Sir,

178
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,000
I understand

179
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:33,200
that the Wind Rider Battalion is a key project,

180
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,000
but our Hurricane Battalion...

181
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:35,920
All right.

182
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,480
I knew you'd speak up.

183
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,680
Don't worry.

184
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,000
You won't be short on budget.

185
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:41,520
Thank you, Sir.

186
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,640
All right, all right. Let's start the meeting.

187
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,360
Good stuff.

188
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,440
This simulation training system

189
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,720
is really good stuff.

190
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,240
After using it just now,

191
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,360
I really got the feeling

192
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,080
of having a million troops under my command.

193
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,560
It's your treat this time, right?

194
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:24,560
My treat.

195
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,360
Tell me,

196
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,280
what do you want to eat?

197
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,040
I heard that

198
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,680
before we left,

199
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,760
Sister-in-law packed you some homemade pickles.

200
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,000
Enough!

201
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:36,880
Out of the question.

202
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,440
Let me tell you,

203
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,400
don't even think about those pickles.

204
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,080
My wife left them for me.

205
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,520
No, no.

206
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,280
Why are you so stingy?

207
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,120
You're almost as bad as Liu Wangyuan.

208
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:46,960
As bad?

209
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,560
How did you know

210
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,400
I had some pickles?

211
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,280
Guo Zijian,

212
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,080
are you spying on me?

213
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:04,480
Tell me,

214
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:05,880
who was it?

215
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,000
Who told you?

216
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:08,440
It's a secret.

217
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,120
A secret, huh?

218
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,400
What?

219
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
If we don't spar a bit,

220
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,520
you won't tell the truth, right?

221
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,520
Can you even beat me?

222
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,960
Even if I can't, I have to try.

223
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,880
Besides, who says I can't beat you?

224
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,320
Battalion Commander Jiang.

225
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,080
Staff Officer Liang.

226
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,440
Carry on. Carry on.

227
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:28,680
Good stuff.

228
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,120
Really good stuff.

229
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,360
Share some pickles with me.

230
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,320
Out of the question.

231
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,320
What's wrong?

232
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,920
Things are wrapped up now.

233
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,200
When are you taking Chen Xiaoshan mountain climbing?

234
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:43,960
What mountain climbing?

235
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,000
Did you forget?

236
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,560
You promised her.

237
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,600
Did I promise?

238
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,600
I forgot.

239
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,560
She's already left, so it doesn't matter.

240
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,200
If you act like this,

241
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,520
girls will get angry.

242
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,400
You know about this stuff?

243
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,880
Why wouldn't I?

244
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,040
I had a senior classmate before.

245
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:06,720
His girlfriend

246
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,560
broke up with him for this exact reason.

247
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,080
Was it really a senior classmate?

248
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:11,720
Yeah.

249
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,280
You don't need to worry about this.

250
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:17,200
Chen Xiaoshan and I aren't like that.

251
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,200
So,

252
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:18,880
it's not an issue.

253
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:31,680
Report.

254
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,160
Come in.

255
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,080
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

256
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,480
"Wind Rider Battalion's Sim Training Practice

257
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,600
on the Scientific Operation of the Value Cube"

258
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,680
has been forwarded by the Theater Army.

259
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,040
Please take a look.

260
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,080
Liang Hong probably sent it to Deputy Army Commander Liang,

261
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,680
who then recommended it.

262
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,680
That's not what happened.

263
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:56,800
You know about it?

264
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,360
The Brigade Commander recommended it.

265
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,400
The Brigade Commander?

266
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:04,160
I see.

267
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:07,160
The Brigade Commander used to be a Director of Operations.

268
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,200
So he's naturally well-connected

269
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:09,920
within the military hierarchy.

270
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,440
Don't talk nonsense without any evidence.

271
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,680
As the Chief of Operations and Training Section,

272
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,680
you should focus on your own work.

273
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,200
Understood.

274
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:23,920
But...

275
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,960
since this has caused such a stir,

276
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,360
won't the Group Army

277
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,080
take some action after this?

278
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:33,200
So you sensed it too.

279
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,640
It seems the big battle to test the results

280
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,720
is about to begin.

281
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,080
Hurry up and get ready.

282
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,760
Yes, sir.

283
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:41,760
Dismissed.

284
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,080
Staff Officer Liang.

285
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:59,160
How about we do this after dinner?

286
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,320
There's a unit dinner later.

287
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,400
Finish today's work today.

288
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,120
There will be other things to do after dinner.

289
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:05,800
Staff Officer Liang,

290
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,840
where do you get

291
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,320
so much energy and stamina every day?

292
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:16,320
Dad.

293
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,680
Dad, calm down first.

294
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:27,960
I understand.

295
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,120
I'll go ask for leave right away.

296
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,240
I'll rush back tonight.

297
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,520
Okay, bye.

298
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,800
Staff Officer Liang, what's wrong?

299
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:38,400
My mom had a sudden heart attack and is in the ER.

300
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:40,600
Wait, Staff Officer Liang.

301
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,320
Don't worry.

302
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:41,760
Well... um...

303
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:42,320
Fall in! Fall in!

304
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,120
Hurry! Fall in!

305
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:44,480
Wait.

306
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,560
Staff Officer Liang...

307
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:47,840
Comrades.

308
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:51,280
We just got an enemy intel report from theater joint command.

309
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,320
The enemy,

310
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,080
with a force of two battalions,

311
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:58,440
equipped with drones and air assault gear,

312
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,400
will, in twelve hours,

313
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:01,640
target our

314
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:03,720
defensive zone's

315
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,760
key chokepoint,

316
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,080
Dongjia Town,

317
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,040
with a surprise attack.

318
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,800
To ensure the safety of the Group Army's rear,

319
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,680
and to prevent the enemy

320
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,520
from using it as a breakthrough point

321
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,320
to divide and encircle our forces,

322
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,800
I order the Wind Rider Battalion

323
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:19,560
to prepare all troops and weapons

324
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,480
and rapidly deploy toward Dongjia Town.

325
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,800
You must, before the enemy arrives,

326
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,000
seize

327
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,800
the Dongjia Town government building.

328
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,800
This not only means that your

329
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,520
unit dinner tonight is canceled,

330
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,280
but it also

331
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,320
requires you to maintain high morale

332
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,920
and sharp tactics

333
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,440
to face this battle.

334
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,680
Are you confident?

335
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,720
We are! We are! We are!

336
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:44,880
Report!

337
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:46,640
Speak.

338
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:47,640
Sir.

339
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,840
May I ask who our opponent is?

340
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,000
No comment.

341
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,240
Go prepare.

342
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,080
Yes, sir!

343
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,040
Battalion, attention!

344
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:09,280
Except for battalion staff and company commanders,

345
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,520
all other personnel, return immediately.

346
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,920
Per combat readiness level requirements,

347
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,360
complete preparations for supplies,

348
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:16,240
equipment,

349
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,880
and personal gear.

350
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,120
Mess squad,

351
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,120
prepare dry rations immediately,

352
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:24,120
and distribute them during the movement.

353
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:24,760
Yes, sir!

354
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:27,640
Everyone, right face!

355
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:28,600
Liang Hong.

356
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:29,560
Liang Hong!

357
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,960
Double time, march!

358
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:31,720
Here!

359
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:32,760
Immediately confirm

360
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,160
the geographical location of Dongjia Town,

361
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,600
and use the BeiDou System for precise positioning.

362
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,160
At the same time,

363
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,480
you must complete

364
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,720
dynamic reconnaissance of the movement route,

365
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:41,760
and consider

366
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,560
the requirements for night movement.

367
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:47,800
All new-type combat forces must immediately initiate

368
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,320
combat readiness level transition.

369
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:50,120
Yes, sir!

370
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,120
1st Company!

371
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:52,720
Here!

372
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,360
1st Company is ordered,

373
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:58,040
along with attached recon, EW, fire, and air defense

374
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,720
forces,

375
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,120
to initiate a level-one combat response immediately.

376
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,480
In twenty minutes,

377
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,840
as the advance unit,

378
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,720
depart.

379
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,480
And make sure

380
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,880
to stay in contact with our battalion command

381
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:08,600
at all times.

382
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,120
Yes, sir!

383
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:10,800
Yang Maolin!

384
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:11,760
Here!

385
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,720
You are ordered to lead the Special Ops Platoon independently.

386
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:15,640
Depart immediately.

387
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,800
Choose your own route and method.

388
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,720
Once you reach the outskirts of Dongjia Town,

389
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:21,680
report to me immediately.

390
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:22,480
Yes, sir!

391
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,720
Special Ops Platoon, right face!

392
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:26,880
Double time, march!

393
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,160
2nd Company, 3rd Company,

394
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:31,120
and all other auxiliary branches,

395
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,280
standby for orders.

396
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,680
Await my deployment at any time.

397
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:34,720
Yes, sir!

398
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,160
Comrades,

399
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,840
although recent training has been good,

400
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,480
I found that some comrades among you

401
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:44,000
seem reluctant to obey my orders.

402
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:45,800
This is unacceptable.

403
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,040
I hold a master's degree in military command.

404
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:52,000
I have participated in Group Army, Theater Army,

405
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,320
and Theater Command exercises, over thirty in total.

406
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:57,200
I was commended by the Theater Command as an outstanding staff officer.

407
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,000
Company Commander,

408
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,360
it is time to depart.

409
00:15:59,480 --> 00:15:59,920
You can talk on the way.

410
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,240
In short,

411
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,720
obey orders and follow commands.

412
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:07,560
I will never allow anyone to act on their own.

413
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:10,920
Report!

414
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,200
Staff Officer Zeng Muhan from battalion command is here.

415
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:13,240
What is he doing here?

416
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,480
Hello, Company Commander Wang.

417
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,040
I am Battalion Staff Officer Zeng Muhan.

418
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,760
The Battalion Commander assigned us to act with 1st Company.

419
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,680
Are you attached to me, or am I attached to you?

420
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,760
1st Company is the main assault company,

421
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,160
so naturally,

422
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:30,440
we are attached to you.

423
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,080
As long as the subordination is clear,

424
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:32,960
things will be easy.

425
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:35,560
I thought the Battalion Commander sent an Imperial inspector.

426
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,680
You must be joking, Company Commander Wang.

427
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,440
It is getting late.

428
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,760
Let's hurry up and move out.

429
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,120
Is everyone ready?

430
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,160
We are ready!

431
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:46,000
Move out!

432
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,720
Everyone, right face!

433
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:50,760
Double time, march!

434
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:15,880
Hu Zhenhua.

435
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:16,560
Yes, sir.

436
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,640
What exactly is your staff section doing?

437
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,400
The intel is just a bunch of webpages.

438
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,560
Why hasn't it been compiled?

439
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:25,080
Sorry.

440
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:26,320
It was my oversight.

441
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:27,440
I'll compile it right now.

442
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:31,440
Staff Officer Liang.

443
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:32,320
Yes, sir.

444
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,600
You're not the only one in the staff section.

445
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,040
If you can't handle it all,

446
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,880
you should delegate the tasks.

447
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,160
Don't hold things up.

448
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:40,680
Understood.

449
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:41,840
It's my fault.

450
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:45,000
What's wrong with you today?

451
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,520
Nothing.

452
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:53,560
Alright, the information has been sent over.

453
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,160
Dongjia Town.

454
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,040
It used to be a mining area.

455
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:59,320
Mostly populated by transients.

456
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:02,160
The coal here was mined out a few years ago.

457
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,800
So most of the people have left.

458
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,480
It's said that the current town government

459
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,960
only left two guards behind.

460
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,880
This mining area has a distinct feature.

461
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,000
The underground network is very complex.

462
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,600
Engaging in combat in a place like this,

463
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:18,920
there's no room to maneuver.

464
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:21,320
This will be a tough battle.

465
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,760
There's no way to gather the opponent's intel for now.

466
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,720
Then we'll gather it as we fight.

467
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,200
Yes, sir.

468
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:42,560
Sir.

469
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,560
The Group Army combat command center just called.

470
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:48,120
All the sites of the remote observation system

471
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,000
have been connected.

472
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,840
The Theater Army and Group Army headquarters,

473
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,160
as well as relevant experts from two academies,

474
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,080
and Professor Zhang,

475
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,360
are already at their respective observation systems

476
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,360
seated and ready to observe.

477
00:18:59,360 --> 00:18:59,880
Good.

478
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,120
Technology really is a great thing.

479
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,000
Notify Ma Mingguo

480
00:19:04,840 --> 00:19:05,760
and ask him to cooperate.

481
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,040
To cover every angle throughout the process

482
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,720
and closely monitor all participating units.

483
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:12,480
This time we need to carefully dissect

484
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,520
this little sparrow, the Wind Rider Battalion.

485
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,880
Yes, sir. I'll notify him immediately.

486
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:19,560
Good.

487
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:21,880
First Company.

488
00:19:22,560 --> 00:19:24,080
Reporting. First Company, Wang Qilin.

489
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,040
We received a notice from Exercise Control.

490
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,680
A portion of the enemy's forces

491
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,640
is already making a motorized movement toward Dongjia Town.

492
00:19:30,080 --> 00:19:32,240
First Company is ordered to speed up your movement.

493
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:32,760
Yes, sir.

494
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:35,240
Order the whole company to speed up.

495
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:35,920
Yes, sir.

496
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:40,000
Our current speed is already fast enough.

497
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,080
I can't believe Guo Zijian still dares to accelerate.

498
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:44,600
This kid

499
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:45,600
has guts.

500
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,320
Professor Zhang.

501
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,120
Calling us here tonight...

502
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,400
Is there some special significance to this exercise?

503
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:53,200
What significance?

504
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,440
We won't have the answer until the exercise ends.

505
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,720
Putting on such a big show. Who are we fighting?

506
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,080
All I know is we're ordered to seize Dongjia Town.

507
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,560
Other than that, I know absolutely nothing.

508
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,800
A blind fight, huh.

509
00:20:18,520 --> 00:20:20,080
But with your methods, Long Yuanshan,

510
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,040
there's no way you don't have a clue.

511
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:27,960
An offensive and defensive battle

512
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:28,840
in a nearly abandoned small town

513
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,560
doesn't allow for a campaign-level decisive battle.

514
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:32,960
Plus,

515
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,360
we're only allowed to deploy a total force of two battalions.

516
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:36,480
So I'm guessing

517
00:20:37,080 --> 00:20:38,840
the opponent is a Combined Arms Battalion.

518
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:42,280
The only Combined Arms Battalions that can spar with you now

519
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,120
are those two "Winds".

520
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:44,800
Reporting!

521
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,240
Brigade Commander Long,

522
00:20:57,320 --> 00:20:58,400
you actually guessed right.

523
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:01,680
It's Guo Zijian's Wind Rider Battalion.

524
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:04,760
There aren't many you'd call a worthy opponent.

525
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:08,440
I've heard a lot about this Guo Zijian.

526
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,400
This time, I'm going to properly face

527
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,560
this legendary figure.

528
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:13,440
Let's see if he's a true hero

529
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:14,640
or just a phony.

530
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,880
Since the Wind Rider Battalion was founded,

531
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:19,360
this is their first battle against our Black Mamba.

532
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,520
I hope they don't disappoint me.

533
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:25,600
Light Infantry Company 1 has finished boarding!

534
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:27,160
Awaiting orders!

535
00:21:28,040 --> 00:21:28,600
Move out!

536
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,000
Attention, all platoons.

537
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:07,200
At the intersection ahead,

538
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,040
get off the highway

539
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:09,400
and switch to the national road.

540
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:16,520
Company Commander,

541
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,440
why are we switching to the national road?

542
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:19,640
Look.

543
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:21,600
Based on the map,

544
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:23,040
switching to the national road saves us

545
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:24,040
over 20 kilometers of travel.

546
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:25,960
This is the only way to arrive on time.

547
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:27,160
Look at this speed.

548
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:29,840
That is quite fast.

549
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:33,600
Commander Ma.

550
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:36,560
Sir is here.

551
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,520
Sir.

552
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:40,240
It is so late.

553
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,960
What instructions do you have for me at this hour?

554
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:43,000
Have a seat.

555
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,720
This exercise is an unexpected situation.

556
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:49,000
You fall directly under the Theater Army.

557
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:50,440
I have no authority to command you.

558
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:52,760
But for your unconditional cooperation,

559
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:53,920
I express my gratitude.

560
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:54,880
Sir.

561
00:22:55,280 --> 00:22:56,640
I do not deserve such praise.

562
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:57,640
I am not finished yet.

563
00:22:58,480 --> 00:22:59,120
Wind Rider Battalion

564
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:01,360
is making its first appearance before Theater leadership.

565
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:03,760
That is why I specifically deployed you.

566
00:23:03,760 --> 00:23:04,360
Understood?

567
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:06,200
Understood. Please rest assured, Sir.

568
00:23:06,520 --> 00:23:08,800
Currently, all channels remain clear.

569
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:10,960
We will absolutely not miss a single detail.

570
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,440
With you here, of course I am assured.

571
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:15,960
Where are we now?

572
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,680
Staff Officer Zeng,

573
00:23:25,520 --> 00:23:26,520
why did we switch to the national road?

574
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:39,520
Company Commander Wang! Company Commander Wang!

575
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:41,440
This is Zeng Muhan. This is Zeng Muhan.

576
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,920
First Company, Wang Qilin. Go ahead.

577
00:23:43,320 --> 00:23:43,840
Company Commander Wang,

578
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:45,480
the national highway hasn't been scouted in advance.

579
00:23:45,480 --> 00:23:46,240
The road conditions are unknown.

580
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:47,840
And it only has two lanes.

581
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,320
The convoy formation is too dense.

582
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,880
If we encounter an ambush...

583
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:51,680
...or an air raid,

584
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,280
the vehicles will struggle to disperse.

585
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,320
We will suffer heavy losses.

586
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:56,200
Our main priority right now is movement speed.

587
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:56,960
Speed is crucial.

588
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,880
If we encounter long-range artillery fire...

589
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:00,120
...or an air assault,

590
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,240
how do we handle it?

591
00:24:01,760 --> 00:24:03,360
The enemy situation report is already very clear.

592
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:05,720
They are moving toward Dongjia Town at full speed.

593
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,920
An ambush halfway is impossible.

594
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:07,640
I suggest

595
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:09,240
the convoy immediately open up a safe distance.

596
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,160
The air defense unit should disperse,

597
00:24:11,280 --> 00:24:12,120
turn on the anti-aircraft radar,

598
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:13,040
and step up air defense alerts.

599
00:24:13,040 --> 00:24:13,680
Staff Officer Zeng.

600
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:14,800
I know

601
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:16,960
you performed excellently in the recent competition.

602
00:24:17,760 --> 00:24:18,720
But you've also heard of

603
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,720
the armchair strategist, right?

604
00:24:24,040 --> 00:24:24,600
Company Commander Wang,

605
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:26,840
it's exactly out of consideration for actual combat

606
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:29,000
that I'm making this suggestion to you.

607
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,680
The validity of the enemy situation report

608
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:31,800
is only guaranteed before it's issued.

609
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:33,080
Once it's issued,

610
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,720
anything can happen.

611
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:35,960
It might even be a trap.

612
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:37,000
Staff Officer Zeng,

613
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:39,160
are you teaching me how to be a Company Commander?

614
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:41,000
I wouldn't dare.

615
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,320
Enough, Staff Officer Zeng.

616
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:43,920
The battle is imminent.

617
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,280
I won't allow anyone

618
00:24:45,280 --> 00:24:46,360
to question my commanding abilities.

619
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:48,200
Your current task

620
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:49,840
is to manage the battalion's recon unit well.

621
00:24:50,080 --> 00:24:50,600
Understood.

622
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,440
In that case,

623
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:54,640
our unit and the First Company's convoy

624
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:55,760
will maintain a proper distance.

625
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:57,680
Distance approved.

626
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:02,240
But falling behind and delaying the battle

627
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,840
won't just mean missing out on the action.

628
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,120
Slow down.

629
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,280
Maintain a safe distance.

630
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:09,320
Yes, sir.

631
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:21,960
Report!

632
00:25:22,320 --> 00:25:23,160
Radar has detected two...

633
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:24,560
No...

634
00:25:24,560 --> 00:25:26,240
three helicopters approaching along the highway.

635
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:27,400
How far are they?

636
00:25:30,120 --> 00:25:31,600
They were intentionally evading radar

637
00:25:31,600 --> 00:25:32,520
and suddenly popped up.

638
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,000
They are...

639
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:35,040
less than two kilometers away.

640
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:37,200
That fast?

641
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:39,840
Notify all vehicles.

642
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:40,800
Turn off lights and engines.

643
00:25:40,880 --> 00:25:41,600
Coast forward.

644
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:42,440
Prepare for a surprise attack.

645
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:43,000
Yes, sir.

646
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,600
Company Commander Wang! Company Commander Wang!

647
00:25:52,120 --> 00:25:54,160
Three enemy gunships are approaching you.

648
00:25:54,560 --> 00:25:55,320
Less than three kilometers away.

649
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:57,160
Disperse the convoy immediately

650
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:58,240
and set up anti-air defenses.

651
00:25:58,400 --> 00:25:59,640
Deputy Company Commander Xu, order the troops.

652
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:01,240
Enemy gunships will be overhead shortly.

653
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,440
Take cover and prepare anti-air defenses.

654
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:02,920
Yes, sir.

655
00:26:03,080 --> 00:26:04,640
Driver, lights off, pull over.

656
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:06,240
Attention, all platoons.

657
00:26:06,360 --> 00:26:08,040
Opposing Force gunships will be overhead shortly.

658
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:09,760
All vehicles, slow down and turn off lights immediately.

659
00:26:09,760 --> 00:26:11,120
Anti-air units attached to the First Company,

660
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,480
prepare for anti-air defense immediately!

661
00:26:33,600 --> 00:26:34,440
Reporting, Company Commander!

662
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:36,200
Half the company is declared KIA.

663
00:26:36,520 --> 00:26:37,320
They are out of the fight.

664
00:26:42,800 --> 00:26:43,520
Deputy Company Commander Xu,

665
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,000
you take command.

666
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,800
They're totally off the playbook.

667
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:48,440
Company Commander,

668
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:51,120
how can you do this at a time like this?

669
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:51,960
The pre-battle report

670
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:54,040
stated the enemy had no armed helicopters.

671
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:56,280
They're breaking the rules. I want a Reprimand.

672
00:26:56,880 --> 00:26:58,800
A Reprimand can wait until after the battle.

673
00:26:58,800 --> 00:27:00,240
We're still in the middle of a fight right now.

674
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:01,880
Zhiqiang, I've already made my decision.

675
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:03,080
For the rest of the battle,

676
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:04,120
you take command.

677
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:20,040
Since setting out, Wang Qilin

678
00:27:20,520 --> 00:27:22,240
has only issued two orders,

679
00:27:22,520 --> 00:27:24,160
and half his forces are already wiped out.

680
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:25,640
What is he good for?

681
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:28,280
Where's their anti-air defense?

682
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:30,960
What has Zeng Muhan been doing?

683
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:32,760
Zeng Muhan...

684
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:34,680
He just reported in.

685
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:37,600
First Company's convoy has diverted to the highway.

686
00:27:37,600 --> 00:27:39,000
Their formation is a bit too tight.

687
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,200
Why didn't you warn First Company?

688
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:45,800
I...

689
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:46,960
I...

690
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,600
What were you doing?

691
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,120
I'm sorry.

692
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:54,560
I just zoned out.

693
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:55,800
Zoned out?

694
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,840
Staff Officer Liang.

695
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:03,120
Because you zoned out,

696
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:05,080
I lost most of a reinforced company.

697
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:11,800
I'm sorry. It's my responsibility.

698
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:12,720
I will bear the consequences.

699
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:14,040
Can you afford to?

700
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:20,560
I can accept a misjudgment made after careful thought,

701
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,480
but I will absolutely not tolerate

702
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,840
a slack work attitude.

703
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,280
You're my chief staff officer.

704
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,800
You zoned out.

705
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:30,160
How am I supposed to fight this battle?

706
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:33,920
Guo Zijian!

707
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,560
Could you be a little more polite?

708
00:28:36,560 --> 00:28:37,320
Polite?

709
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,240
Polite to whom?

710
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,400
Will the enemy be polite to you?

711
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:49,600
This is a battlefield!

712
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:51,640
So many men were wiped out before reaching the battlefield!

713
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:52,840
Who can they go cry to?

714
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,880
Everything you say makes sense,

715
00:28:55,520 --> 00:28:57,240
but you shouldn't be unforgiving when right.

716
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:58,400
That's how I am. So what?

717
00:28:58,880 --> 00:28:59,840
I'm telling you all,

718
00:29:00,840 --> 00:29:01,880
we are fighting a war right now.

719
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,040
Pull yourselves together!

720
00:29:04,760 --> 00:29:06,000
Yes, sir!

721
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:23,160
Company Commander Wang.

722
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:24,560
We can't stay here.

723
00:29:24,760 --> 00:29:25,640
We must keep moving forward.

724
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:26,720
Staff Officer Zeng...

725
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:28,600
I've had

726
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:30,720
this old issue with low blood sugar.

727
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:32,120
It's acting up again.

728
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,280
The 1st Company...

729
00:29:34,760 --> 00:29:35,400
I'm leaving it to you for now.

730
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:36,840
Staff Officer Zeng,

731
00:29:37,360 --> 00:29:38,280
you're the staff officer from the battalion.

732
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:40,080
Please take command of the troops.

733
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:41,080
Right now,

734
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:43,400
the 1st Company is counting on you.

735
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:44,880
Where's the Political Instructor?

736
00:29:45,360 --> 00:29:45,880
He's already been eliminated.

737
00:29:46,280 --> 00:29:47,200
He's sulking up ahead.

738
00:29:47,800 --> 00:29:48,400
All right.

739
00:29:49,600 --> 00:29:50,800
I'll cover for you until you recover.

740
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:01,520
All personnel of the 1st Company,

741
00:30:02,360 --> 00:30:03,280
this is Zeng Muhan.

742
00:30:04,280 --> 00:30:05,320
From now on,

743
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:06,560
you are under my command.

744
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:08,440
All operational vehicles and personnel,

745
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:09,720
mount up immediately.

746
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,000
Form a single column,

747
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:11,960
maintain spacing,

748
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,000
and advance rapidly.

749
00:30:13,320 --> 00:30:13,800
Meanwhile,

750
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,120
one recon vehicle

751
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,840
is to push forward and scout the road.

752
00:30:17,080 --> 00:30:19,040
The attached battalion air defense radar

753
00:30:19,280 --> 00:30:20,200
must operate intermittently,

754
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:22,840
and keep its distance from the main force.

755
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:24,800
Security detachment, stay alert.

756
00:30:25,120 --> 00:30:26,720
All disabled vehicles and personnel,

757
00:30:26,840 --> 00:30:27,800
pull over to the roadside.

758
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:28,840
Stay safe.

759
00:30:29,520 --> 00:30:30,280
As for everything else,

760
00:30:30,840 --> 00:30:31,600
wait for further notice

761
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:32,920
after we move out.

762
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:45,720
Sir.

763
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:47,800
According to Exercise Control's statistics,

764
00:30:48,360 --> 00:30:50,120
Long Yuanshan's long-range interception just now

765
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:52,840
took 60% of the Combined Arms 1st Company out of action.

766
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:54,600
Barring any surprises,

767
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:55,600
this company

768
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,440
is just one step away

769
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:58,640
from completely losing its combat effectiveness.

770
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:03,120
There is the Horseshoe Effect on the Western battlefield.

771
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,160
Sir,

772
00:31:04,600 --> 00:31:05,320
I think

773
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:07,440
the 1st Company is demonstrating it right here.

774
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:14,440
1st Company.

775
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:15,440
Reporting to the Battalion Commander.

776
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:16,080
This is Zeng Muhan.

777
00:31:17,360 --> 00:31:19,000
Were all of the 1st Company's commanding officers KIA?

778
00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:20,240
Why are you in command?

779
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:22,040
The Political Instructor was KIA.

780
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:23,600
The Company Commander had a sudden medical emergency.

781
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,280
I am currently acting as the 1st Company's commander.

782
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,400
Awaiting your orders, Battalion Commander.

783
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,880
Report the 1st Company's current status.

784
00:31:29,760 --> 00:31:31,000
All personnel and equipment have been regrouped.

785
00:31:31,320 --> 00:31:32,640
We are rapidly maneuvering toward Dongjia Town.

786
00:31:33,960 --> 00:31:34,800
Step up reconnaissance.

787
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,400
Seize favorable terrain as quickly as possible.

788
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:38,280
The enemy is equipped with air power.

789
00:31:38,520 --> 00:31:40,040
They will secure the favorable terrain before we do.

790
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:41,760
I am working on a battle plan.

791
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:42,840
Good.

792
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,600
Report any enemy movements immediately.

793
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:45,400
Yes, sir.

794
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:52,120
They still managed to exploit a loophole.

795
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:53,080
What do you mean?

796
00:32:53,520 --> 00:32:54,640
The use of Air Assault.

797
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,160
Your staff team,

798
00:32:57,600 --> 00:32:59,400
why didn't you make a plan for it earlier?

799
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,760
It's mainly because this Air Assault brigade

800
00:33:03,760 --> 00:33:04,680
is too far away.

801
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:06,800
I calculated the distance at the time.

802
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:07,840
Even if

803
00:33:07,840 --> 00:33:10,200
we used helicopters to extract the 1st Company,

804
00:33:10,200 --> 00:33:11,920
the time it'd take compared to going there ourselves

805
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:12,600
would be exactly the same.

806
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:14,440
But at least it wouldn't let the enemy

807
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,680
succeed so easily.

808
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,680
It's already in the past.

809
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:22,040
So let's drop it, okay?

810
00:33:22,840 --> 00:33:23,640
The battle isn't over yet.

811
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:26,680
Mountain Eagle, Mountain Eagle.

812
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,040
This is Honey Badger.

813
00:33:28,760 --> 00:33:29,400
This is Mountain Eagle.

814
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:30,000
Go ahead.

815
00:33:30,560 --> 00:33:31,640
I'm approaching the target.

816
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,240
Concealment complete.

817
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:34,240
Awaiting orders.

818
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:36,600
Find the enemy leaders and execute a decapitation strike.

819
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:37,520
This is currently

820
00:33:37,680 --> 00:33:39,520
the only way to turn the tide.

821
00:33:40,560 --> 00:33:41,400
Honey Badger copies.

822
00:33:43,880 --> 00:33:45,520
If only we had a few more Yang Maolins.

823
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:47,360
We're still short on manpower.

824
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:51,920
Battalion Commander Guo.

825
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:55,800
If you think I'm incompetent,

826
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:56,640
you can submit a report.

827
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:57,680
I can leave at any time.

828
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:04,520
I wasn't aiming that at you.

829
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,200
You're overthinking it.

830
00:34:10,680 --> 00:34:12,800
What's going on with you two today?

831
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:16,360
One is prickly all over,

832
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,200
poking everyone in sight.

833
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:19,400
And the other just lets himself get poked.

834
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:22,200
If you two keep this attitude today,

835
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:23,200
how are we supposed to fight this battle?

836
00:34:38,080 --> 00:34:38,840
Reporting, Company Commander.

837
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:40,440
Our company has reached the outskirts of Dongjia Town.

838
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,560
Since the enemy chose air maneuver,

839
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,600
they couldn't have brought heavy equipment.

840
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:48,800
It's highly likely one or two light infantry companies.

841
00:34:51,200 --> 00:34:51,600
In that case,

842
00:34:51,600 --> 00:34:53,440
even though we lack heavy equipment,

843
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:56,080
we have the upper hand with other gear.

844
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:57,120
We can put up a fight.

845
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:00,000
It was just a thought.

846
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,400
I haven't thought it through yet.

847
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,440
As a commander,

848
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:04,560
you must think things through

849
00:35:04,560 --> 00:35:06,000
one or two steps ahead,

850
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,000
even three or four steps.

851
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:09,840
I've decided

852
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:12,000
to gather all the equipment

853
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,240
and forces of First Company.

854
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:15,480
First, we'll secure the key point in Dongjia Town

855
00:35:16,040 --> 00:35:16,720
and hold it until backup arrives.

856
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:18,640
Once the reinforcements get here,

857
00:35:18,880 --> 00:35:21,880
we'll launch a full-scale assault on the town hall.

858
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:22,680
But...

859
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:23,360
Enough.

860
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:24,960
It's settled.

861
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:25,920
Wait a minute.

862
00:35:28,040 --> 00:35:28,760
I don't think that'll work.

863
00:35:29,720 --> 00:35:31,320
It's clearly an opportunity. Why not?

864
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:33,600
First Company has taken heavy casualties.

865
00:35:34,040 --> 00:35:35,120
Even if they don't have heavy weapons,

866
00:35:35,560 --> 00:35:37,000
we aren't fit for a high-intensity assault.

867
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:39,560
Unless the target is clear

868
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:40,960
and an important stronghold,

869
00:35:41,680 --> 00:35:42,200
otherwise,

870
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,480
our heavy weapons won't give us much of an edge.

871
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:45,560
Then you tell me,

872
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:47,040
how should we fight?

873
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,120
I suggest

874
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,080
dividing our men and gear into two groups.

875
00:35:51,640 --> 00:35:52,200
One group

876
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:54,200
will advance to the jungle south of the town hall

877
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,000
and stay hidden on standby.

878
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,040
The other group

879
00:35:56,600 --> 00:35:58,080
will infiltrate light to seek combat opportunities.

880
00:35:58,640 --> 00:36:00,720
Meanwhile, conduct a full recon of Dongjia Town

881
00:36:01,160 --> 00:36:01,880
to locate the enemy's

882
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,120
key defense positions

883
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:06,160
and provide exact coordinates for our heavy firepower.

884
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,480
Fine.

885
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:10,800
Let's do that.

886
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:12,640
I'll implement it immediately.

887
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,360
Before and after initiating the operation,

888
00:36:14,680 --> 00:36:15,520
report promptly to the Battalion Commander.

889
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:16,440
Yes, sir.

890
00:36:19,720 --> 00:36:20,120
Sir.

891
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:22,200
Battalion Commander.

892
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,240
First Company reached the outskirts of Dongjia Town.

893
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:25,800
Here is their proposed combat plan.

894
00:36:33,960 --> 00:36:34,400
Approved.

895
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:35,440
Add one more thing.

896
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,240
Dongjia Town is an old mining area.

897
00:36:37,680 --> 00:36:39,840
They must watch out for tunnels during urban combat.

898
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:40,440
Yes, sir.

899
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:46,720
The Opposing Force's tactical skills are solid.

900
00:36:47,600 --> 00:36:49,840
The defense points they built are quite tricky.

901
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:51,840
Echeloned from front to back,

902
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:53,400
staggered and arranged together,

903
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:54,680
supporting each other.

904
00:36:55,320 --> 00:36:56,160
Interesting.

905
00:36:58,200 --> 00:36:59,280
Why does it look familiar?

906
00:37:00,120 --> 00:37:00,800
Look, guys.

907
00:37:01,080 --> 00:37:01,680
Doesn't this look like

908
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:03,400
the assignment our Platoon Leader gave me last time?

909
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,720
The 404th Brigade's modern urban combat tactics.

910
00:37:07,680 --> 00:37:08,520
It really does.

911
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:09,760
It's just a pity

912
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:11,480
Platoon Leader Yang isn't with us today.

913
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,080
And Staff Officer Zeng is too busy for us.

914
00:37:14,120 --> 00:37:14,720
How about

915
00:37:15,120 --> 00:37:16,000
we send our preliminary assessments

916
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:17,000
to the Battalion Commander first?

917
00:37:19,040 --> 00:37:19,920
Sounds good to me.

918
00:37:22,560 --> 00:37:24,000
There are six target points in total.

919
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:27,480
These kids really did us proud.

920
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:30,280
They actually figured out it's the 404th Brigade.

921
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,680
Since the exercise began,

922
00:37:32,680 --> 00:37:34,000
this is the best news I've heard.

923
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:34,640
Hu Zhenhua.

924
00:37:34,640 --> 00:37:35,160
Here, sir!

925
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:37,360
Order the Long-Range Artillery unit to launch

926
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,520
precision strikes on the above targets.

927
00:37:38,520 --> 00:37:38,920
Yes, sir.

928
00:37:57,040 --> 00:37:58,720
Why isn't the Long-Range Artillery assessment out yet?

929
00:38:04,480 --> 00:38:05,160
Battalion Commander!

930
00:38:06,040 --> 00:38:06,840
This is way too coincidental.

931
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,520
We were just about to activate the Long-Range Artillery,

932
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:09,520
and it got wiped out.

933
00:38:34,120 --> 00:38:34,600
Staff Officer Zeng.

934
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:36,080
Battalion Command just reported.

935
00:38:36,560 --> 00:38:37,320
The 2nd and 3rd Companies

936
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,200
will take another 20 minutes

937
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:40,480
to reach the outskirts of Dongjia Town.

938
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:43,240
They will then mass forces for a full-scale assault.

939
00:38:44,440 --> 00:38:46,040
Then why don't we strike first?

940
00:38:46,200 --> 00:38:47,440
We could even claim top credit.

941
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:49,040
Personal credit is secondary.

942
00:38:49,640 --> 00:38:51,520
Coordinating the whole battle is what matters most.

943
00:38:54,120 --> 00:38:55,240
Then according to you,

944
00:38:56,120 --> 00:38:56,760
how do we fight?

945
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:59,440
Before the Opposing Force's heavy firepower arrives,

946
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,800
we infiltrate their defense zone

947
00:39:02,560 --> 00:39:04,240
to neutralize their heavy weapon advantage.

948
00:39:04,680 --> 00:39:05,320
I don't think so.

949
00:39:06,080 --> 00:39:06,920
In the current situation,

950
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:09,040
military textbooks are very clear.

951
00:39:09,280 --> 00:39:11,640
We'll soon face an urban meat grinder.

952
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:13,040
All urban combat

953
00:39:13,240 --> 00:39:14,640
is a knife fight in a phone booth.

954
00:39:15,440 --> 00:39:17,480
We can't rely on large-scale heavy weapons to crush them.

955
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:18,600
Instead,

956
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:21,520
the piecemeal annihilation tactic of small assault groups

957
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,200
is the key to victory.

958
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,320
I support Staff Officer Zeng's idea.

959
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:27,720
A few days ago,

960
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:29,640
when we studied urban combat,

961
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:30,600
Staff Officer Liang also mentioned it.

962
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:34,240
A commander's influence on the course of battle

963
00:39:34,240 --> 00:39:35,480
is much smaller than in the field.

964
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:38,040
Many things depend on the commander

965
00:39:38,040 --> 00:39:39,720
and the initiative of individual soldiers.

966
00:39:40,160 --> 00:39:41,040
I know,

967
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:43,720
but this is Dongjia Town.

968
00:39:44,480 --> 00:39:45,960
It's not Moscow or Berlin,

969
00:39:46,200 --> 00:39:48,040
let alone Mogadishu or Grozny.

970
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:49,560
But they all share

971
00:39:49,560 --> 00:39:51,320
the basic features of modern urban combat.

972
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:52,640
On the way here,

973
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:54,040
I gained a comprehensive understanding

974
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:55,320
of Dongjia Town's terrain.

975
00:39:56,040 --> 00:39:57,960
Because of the mining area's drainage,

976
00:39:58,240 --> 00:39:59,800
there are many underground tunnels.

977
00:40:00,080 --> 00:40:01,040
If we can make good use

978
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:01,880
of these underground tunnels

979
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:02,680
to infiltrate secretly,

980
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:04,240
it will solve a lot of problems.

981
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:05,600
Fine.

982
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:07,920
Into the tunnels.

983
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:10,640
Deputy Company Commander Xu.

984
00:40:10,720 --> 00:40:11,080
Here.

985
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,400
Order the troops.

986
00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:13,680
After entering the tunnels,

987
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:15,560
form three-man teams and advance alternately.

988
00:40:16,040 --> 00:40:17,000
Be careful not to alert the enemy.

989
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:17,520
Yes, sir.

990
00:40:22,200 --> 00:40:22,880
Platoon Commander.

991
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:26,040
I guess the Opposing Force's commander, like ours,

992
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:28,400
must be commanding from a command vehicle.

993
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:30,080
They won't set up a physical command post.

994
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:34,800
You don't need to lecture me on that.

995
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:36,760
Even if we're looking for the command vehicle,

996
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,760
we have to find clues from the guard deployment

997
00:40:39,760 --> 00:40:40,600
of their security forces.

998
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,520
Any discoveries?

999
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:43,400
No.

1000
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,800
Although the town hall is the combat focus,

1001
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:48,280
it's obvious

1002
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:50,640
the command center isn't there.

1003
00:40:52,480 --> 00:40:53,560
Battalion Commander.

1004
00:40:53,640 --> 00:40:55,200
The 2nd Company and attached units

1005
00:40:55,200 --> 00:40:56,920
have all reached the east side of Dongjia Town

1006
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:58,720
and are ready for the assault.

1007
00:40:59,600 --> 00:41:01,120
The 3rd Company and attached units

1008
00:41:01,160 --> 00:41:02,800
have all reached the west side of Dongjia Town

1009
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,800
and are ready for the assault.

1010
00:41:05,520 --> 00:41:06,120
Orders:

1011
00:41:06,520 --> 00:41:08,920
assault the town hall in five minutes.

1012
00:41:09,680 --> 00:41:10,200
Report.

1013
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:12,680
Opposing Force heavy equipment is under ten kilometers away.

1014
00:41:12,720 --> 00:41:13,560
In 15 minutes,

1015
00:41:13,560 --> 00:41:14,920
they will form a pincer attack.

1016
00:41:16,680 --> 00:41:17,480
The 2nd and 3rd Companies

1017
00:41:17,840 --> 00:41:19,400
will push deep into Dongjia Town

1018
00:41:19,720 --> 00:41:22,240
and immediately form an interlocking position.

1019
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:24,000
Seize three to four high points

1020
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:25,560
to counter their reinforcements.

1021
00:41:26,080 --> 00:41:26,560
Understood.

1022
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:43,760
Second Company, Third Company,

1023
00:42:44,160 --> 00:42:45,280
immediately organize by platoons

1024
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:46,680
to form small assault teams.

1025
00:42:47,240 --> 00:42:48,640
According to the established battle plan,

1026
00:42:48,680 --> 00:42:49,520
upon engaging the enemy,

1027
00:42:49,680 --> 00:42:51,600
immediately advance deep into the town.
